    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39222" root="نبر" body-key="n">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتبر</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a heap of wheat) <i>rose,</i> by additions.
(T.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>It</i> (the body, M, K, and a wound,
T, A) <i>swelled; became swollen.</i> (T, M, A, K.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>It</i> (the mouth, TA,) <i>became blistered,</i> or
<i>vesicated.</i> (K, TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انتبرت يَدُهُ</span> <i>His arm,</i>
or <i>hand, became blistered.</i> (S, A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <i>He</i> (the
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَمِير</span>, M, and the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطِيب</span>, K) <i>ascended the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْبَر</span>
[or <i>pulpit</i>]. (M, K.)

